OL,3,APope in 'pretty good health' as he
OL,4,Astarts Latin America tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has told reporters
OL,7,Ftravelling with him to Latin America he
OL,8,Fis "in pretty good health", in his
OL,9,Ffirst comments on his condition since
OL,10,Fhaving surgery for lung cancer.
OL,12,FThe Pope has arrived in Uruguay, the
OL,13,Ffirst stop of a 12-day tour which he is
OL,14,Fundertaking only three weeks after his
OL,15,Foperation.
OL,17,FThe pontiff, 71, also said he was "very
OL,18,Fhappy" to be able to make the trip
OL,19,Fwhich was thrown into doubt last month
OL,20,Fwhen doctors discovered a tumour during
OL,21,Fa routine scan.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
