OL,3,APope in 'pretty good health' as he
OL,4,Astarts Latin America tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tour will cover Argentina and a
OL,7,Fmuch anticipated return to Peru, which
OL,8,Fthe Vatican described as a "homecoming"
OL,9,Fas the Pope was based there for many
OL,10,Fyears as a missionary, then a bishop.
